Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Halberd
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 13 Strength

Weight: 15"


	SAY NAME2 "Ravager +4"
	SAY DESC "Taking the blood-soaked shaft of this weapon in hand brings a sudden chill along your spine. The origins of this gruesome halberd are unknown, the myth says it can slay the opponents with a single blow—unless they can survive the sudden loss of their head.  

STATISTICS:

