//BOOMERANG DAGGER +2/
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/DAGG11.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Dagger"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The typical dagger has a pointed, usually double-edged blade, as opposed to a knife, which has a single edge and is a bit shorter.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d4 (piercing)
Speed Factor: 2
Proficiency Type: Dagger
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength

Weight: 1"


	SAY NAME2 "Boomerang Dagger +2"
	SAY DESC "Fullen Woolspinner, an ambitious halfling from a well-to-do family, left his home to spend several years adventuring. During his travels, he ended up staying with a family of dwarven weaponsmiths. Much impressed by their throwing axes, which always returned to the hands of their wielder, Fullen sought to make a dagger that could do the same. With the help of his dwarven friends, he succeeded, creating several of the famous Fullen Boomerang daggers.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Returns to the wielder's hand when thrown

THAC0: +2
Damage: 1d4+2
Damage type (melee): Piercing
Damage type (thrown): Missile
Speed Factor: 1
Proficiency Type: Dagger
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength

Weight: 1"




//PIRATE DAGGER +1//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/TB#DAG01.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Dagger"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The typical throwing dagger has a pointed, usually double-edged blade, as opposed to a knife, which has a single edge and is a bit shorter than the dagger. Unlike a dagger, this one has a smaller handle and is balanced differently.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 2
Proficiency Type: Dagger
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength

Weight: 0"

	SAY NAME2 "Pirate Dagger +1"
	SAY DESC "This special throwing dagger is often used by the most sadistic pirates of the Sea of Swords to avoid losing precious ammunition.
	First, the prisoners are thrown into the sea, then bets are placed on who can hit and kill them.
	The most common problems in this game are sharks and sea monsters, which are often faster than the pirates themselves...

STATISTICS:


Combat abilities:
– Returns to the wielder's hand when thrown

THAC0: +1
Damage: 1d4+1
Damage type (melee): Piercing
Damage type (thrown): Missile
Speed Factor: 1
Proficiency Type: Dagger
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength

Weight: 0"


