	SAY NAME1 "Dagger"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The typical throwing dagger has a pointed, usually double-edged blade, as opposed to a knife, which has a single edge and is a bit shorter than the dagger. Unlike a dagger, this one has a smaller handle and is balanced differently.

