	SAY DESC "This is the morning star of Kiel the Legion Killer, firstborn son of Durlag Trollkiller and Clan-prince of his father's ill-fated tower. He was wielding it in his final hour as he rushed to warn his father of the doppelgangers' infiltration of their Clan-home. It is said that the intensity of his rage in these final moments permanently imprinted itself upon the weapon.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Chance to score a critical hit: +5% (with this weapon only)

