	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The flail is a sturdy wooden handle attached to an iron rod, a wooden rod with spikes, or a spiked iron ball. Between the handle and its implement is either a hinge or chain link. The weapon was originally used as a tool for threshing grain.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 2d4+1 (crushing)
Speed Factor: 7
Proficiency Type: Flail/Morning Star
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 13 Strength

Weight: 15"

	SAY NAME2 "Flail of Ages +4"
	SAY DESC "This four-headed flail causes fire, cold, acid, and poison damage. If the fifth head for the Flail of Ages could be found, it would make this awesome weapon even more powerful.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– 33% chance each hit that target will be slowed for 20 seconds
- Magic Resistance: +10%

THAC0: +4
Damage: 2d4+5, +1 fire damage, +1 cold damage, +1 acid damage, +1 electrical damage
Damage type: Crushing
Speed Factor: 3
Proficiency Type: Flail/Morning Star
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 13 Strength

Weight: 9"






