Combat abilities:
– Chance to go berserk 25% every hit (you have the same bonuses as a Berserker Rage, but cannot be controlled).

THAC0: +3
Damage: 2d6+3 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 7
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 12" 






